# --- Audit output and local runs ---
# A run writes its files into audit-<slug>/ (see audit-data-format.md). The leading slash keeps this to the
# repo root, so the tracked tests/fixtures/sample-run/audit-data/ isn't caught.
/audit-*/
website/
test-runs/
# What a scan leaves in the repo root when it runs without --out
/perf-a11y.json
/mobile-metrics.json
/design-tokens.json
/design-pages.json
/seo-sweep.json
/tracking.json
/interaction.json
/security-scan.json
/security.md
/assets/
/*.png

